\begin{tabular}{ccc}
\hline
$c$ & $P(\sum X_i \leq c)$ & $P(\sum X_i > c)$ \\
\hline
$2$ & $0.9197$ & $0.0803$ \\
$3$ & $0.9810$ & $0.0190$ \\
\hline
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
因为分布离散，取 $c = 3$，随机化参数 $r$ 由 $E_{\lambda_0}[\phi(\boldsymbol{X})] = \alpha$ 确定：
$$P_{\lambda_0}\left(\sum X_i > 3\right) + r \cdot P_{\lambda_0}\left(\sum X_i = 3\right) = 0.05$$
$$0.0190 + r \times (0.9810 - 0.9197) = 0.05$$
$$r = \frac{0.05 - 0.0190}{0.0613} \approx 0.506$$
故检验函数为
$$\phi(\boldsymbol{X}) = \begin{cases} 1, & \sum_{i=1}^n X_i > 3 \\ 0.506, & \sum_{i=1}^n X_i = 3 \\ 0, & \sum_{i=1}^n X_i < 3 \end{cases}$$
\end{solution}

